---
import Signature from './Signature.astro';
---

<section id="about" class="section section--alt">
  <div class="wrap about">
    <div class="about__portrait">
      {/* TODO: swap in a real photo of Jennifer, ideally in her studio.
          Buyers connect with the maker — this image does real work. */}
      <img
        src="/images/jennifer-mazer-portrait.svg"
        alt="Portrait of artist Jennifer Mazer in her studio"
        loading="lazy"
        decoding="async"
        width="800"
        height="1000"
      />
    </div>

    <div class="about__copy">
      <p class="eyebrow">About the Artist</p>
      <h2>Jennifer Mazer</h2>

      {/* TODO — replace with Jennifer's real bio, in her own voice.
          200–300 words. Where she's from, how she started painting, what she's
          drawn to, and how the party work grew out of the art. This is the
          second-most-read section on any artist site after the gallery. */}
      <p>
        Jennifer paints citrus the way she remembers it — lemons and blood
        oranges glowing against deep navy, orange blossoms scattered like
        they've just come off the branch. Acrylic on canvas, built in layers
        until the fruit holds its own light.
      </p>
      <p>
        The same eye runs through everything else she makes. A hand-painted
        banner for a first birthday. A baby shower where the favors, the table,
        and the pastries all came out of one sketchbook page. She has never been
        able to design just one part of something.
      </p>
      <p>
        Every piece and every party is made by hand, one at a time, for the
        person who asked for it.
      </p>

      <Signature height="3.25rem" color="var(--navy)" class="about__sig" />
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 0.85fr) minmax(0, 1.15fr);
    gap: clamp(2rem, 6vw, 4.5rem);
    align-items: center;
  }

  .about__portrait {
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    overflow: hidden;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    background: var(--cream-deep);
    aspect-ratio: 4 / 5;
  }

  .about__portrait img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .about__sig {
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
  }

  @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
    .about__sig { color: var(--lemon) !important; }
  }

  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .about { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .about__portrait { max-width: 420px; }
  }
</style>
